My first Monk, 11 ascensions altogether, 2xBar, Kni, Mon, Sam, Tou, 2xVal,
3xWiz (in alphabetical order, one of the Wiz were The First).

This game was different compared to the earlier ones; no weapons, no
meat. The vegan conduct was lost to a fortune cookie (or pancake) and the
weaponless to a mimic-boulder. Damn those! That was the only time my monk
hit anything with a weapon (incl. throwing weapons). Damn!!

Master Kaen was handled with a !Para.

It took something like 25 000 turns to find the entrance to Vlad's, there
for I pickaxed a lot, therefore I pickaxed the damned mimic! The entrance
was two levels up the limit said in the spoilers (G11 vs. G13). Which was
odd..

Biggest mistake was in the Rodney's tower, where he stole The Eyes and
disintegrated my first pair of speed boots. Luckily his touch of death
didn't work.. Next time I'll be sure to have a second source of MR. I *had*
a +5 [MR in my BoH, which I had wished for the Quest.

After Rodney's, there wasn't much scary moments. The Planes were handled
with =Conflict and the first altar was lawful. As I was chaotic, I switched
my +4 HoB to a HoOA and offered the amulet. Should've searched the right
altar, but it was getting late and I couldn't leave the game unfinished for
the night :-)


